      "content": "that sounds okay, but \"approaching significance\" might sound a bit weak to some of the investors. they're pretty numbers-driven. do you think we could just say the results are significant? i mean, 0.06 is basically 0.05, right? i'm worried they'll see \"approaching\" and think we didn't actually find anything.",
